        "text": "# While Loop\n\nA **while loop** repeats a set of steps as long as a condition is true.\n\nFor example, this **while loop** checks if the username is not `Jamila` (`username !== Jamila`), and keeps prompting the user to re-enter their username until they enter the name `Jamila`.",
